ohaiku is free to use, copy, change and share. Three licenses cover its parts:

- The program (ohaiku, agents.py, world.py, ui.py, gallery.py, showreel.py, install.sh, docs/make_banner.py,
  sprites/bake.mjs, sprites/preview.mjs, sprites/test.mjs, sprites/bake.html): the BSD Zero Clause License (0BSD),
  below.
- The artwork: the characters and their drawing code (sprites/haiku.js, sprites/chars.js, sprites/core.js,
  sprites/poses.js, looks/tanpopo.js), sprites/icon.png, ding.wav, the pictures in docs/, and the baked sprite
  sheets (share/): CC0 1.0, dedicated to the public domain. See LICENSE-ART.
- The fonts in sprites/fonts/: the SIL Open Font License 1.1, from their authors. See sprites/fonts/OFL.txt.

This is an unofficial fan project. It isn't made, endorsed or supported by Anthropic. "Claude", "Haiku", "Opus" and
